@startuml sequence_search_filter
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Search and Filter - Client Side

actor User
participant "MyTicketsComponent" as Comp
participant "MyTicketsStore" as Store

note over Store: State already loaded:\ntickets[], teamMembers[],\nsearchTerm='', activeFilter='all'

== Search ==

User -> Comp: Type "bug fix" in search
Comp -> Store: setSearchTerm("bug fix")
Store -> Store: patchState({searchTerm: "bug fix"})
Store --> Comp: filteredTickets$ recomputes
note right: Selector combines tickets +\nsearchTerm + activeFilter
Comp --> User: Render filtered list

== Filter ==

User -> Comp: Click "In Progress" chip
Comp -> Store: setFilter("in-progress")
Store -> Store: patchState({activeFilter: "in-progress"})
Store --> Comp: filteredTickets$ recomputes
Comp --> User: Render filtered list

note over Store: No HTTP calls made.\nFiltering is pure\nstate transformation.

@enduml
